{"id": "70268", "title": "只求你爱我", "author": "梦幻", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 6, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70268.htm", "intro": "主要人物——\n    方祖奇——他冷漠、对所有事与物都事不管己，独对她例外。\n    李贝娜——困惑于两男之间，到底是爱还是欲？\n    许誉节——笑脸迎人、来者不拒的他，却无法对她一视同仁。\n    林俊洋——爱上一个心已有所属的女子。", "base": "files/article/html/70/70268", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "1-5", "file": "10914120.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10914121.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10914122.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10914123.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10914150.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-31", "file": "10914151.html", "available": false}]}